                    <details class="roi-faq__item">
                        <summary>How does this website ROI calculator estimate lost revenue?</summary>
                        <p>
                            The current-state estimate uses monthly traffic, conversion rate, lead-to-close rate,
                            and average project value. The scenarios then raise conversion rate only and recalculate
                            the revenue impact from there.
